<title>CROATIA: Croatia Jan-Sept '96 c/a deficit falls to $745 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatia Jan-Sept '96 c/a deficit falls to $745 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA BALANCE OF PAYMENTS   JAN-SEPT 96    JAN-SEPT 95</p>
<p> Current account (million USD)	 -745.5	  -1,156.6</p>
<p> Capital and fin. account	   361.7	     199.1</p>
<p> -Reserve assets		     -536.8	    -399.9</p>
<p> Net errors and omissions	   383.8	     957.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- Figures are cumulative.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
